{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a series of surreal dreams where nothing behaves as expected.<br>This short first-person horror game blends unsettling atmosphere with puzzle-like challenges, creating moments of confusion, tension, and discovery.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong> - Fear born in the mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream Puzzles</strong> - Each dream presents a unique challenge with strange logic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric &amp; Surreal</strong> - Minimal UI, no dialogue, just raw immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compact Experience</strong> - Designed to be finished in one sitting, but with difficulty that rewards persistence and experimentation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, adapt, and escape the logic of dreams - if you can.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022490?t=1771545145","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022490?t=1771545145","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022490/ce4db2d8476c4dd0100a81f940fb6ba9c3f28d91/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771545145","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022490/ce4db2d8476c4dd0100a81f940fb6ba9c3f28d91/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771545145","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a series of surreal dreams where nothing behaves as expected.<br>This short first-person horror game blends unsettling atmosphere with puzzle-like challenges, creating moments of confusion, tension, and discovery.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong> - Fear born in the mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_